  "definition": "Practical Experience Requirements for Independent Clinical Social Workers",
  "effectiveDate": "2026-02-17",
  "expirationDate": "2036-02-17",
  "historyNote": "#10857, eff 6-24-15 (from Mhp 302.14); ss by #13786, eff 12-19-23 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Mhp 300); ss by #14464, eff 2-17-26, EXPIRES 2-17-36",
